{"synopsis":"“Aku akan menjadi lebih kuat dengan memakan monster!” Rude adalah petualang peringkat E yang hanya memiliki satu keterampilan: Debuff Immunity. Sedihnya, mengumpulkan tumbuhan di dungeon yang dipenuhi racun adalah satu-satunya keahliannya. Karena praktis tidak ada gunanya dalam pertempuran, rekan-rekan petualangnya mengejeknya, menyebutnya sebagai “pemulung miasma.\n”Rude memutuskan untuk menantang dungeon baru, bertekad untuk membersihkan namanyaーsampai bencana melanda, dan dia dikhianati oleh rekan-rekannya. Kehabisan item dan di ambang kematian, dia terpaksa melakukan tindakan tabu yaitu memakan daging monster, tapi…? Maka dimulailah petualangan Rude yang hanya memakan monster untuk mendapatkan skill baru!","alternative_title":"魔物喰らいの冒険者～俺だけ魔物を喰らって強くなる～, Mamono Kurai no Boukensha - Ore Dake Mamono wo Kuratte Tsuyoku Naru, Monster Eater Adventurer","author":"Egashira, Renkinou","artist":"Ichimatsu Kei","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"ch_99","number":"99","chapter":"99","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_98","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_97","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_96","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_95","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_94","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_93","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_92","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_91","nu